    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a SmartTools user",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want to filter Automobile map results before viewing them",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So that I can focus analysis on the tests, network conditions and devices relevant to my investigation.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Issue/Change Description:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Provide shared filters for standard Automobile map layers. Support a rolling 90-day time range; handset filters for MSISDN, SIM MNC and SIM MCC; technology filters for Unknown, 2G, 3G, 4G, 5G NSA and 5G SA; configuration-supplied frequencies; network filters for MCC, MNC, LAC, CI, Site and Cell; and configuration-supplied device groups."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Call excludes 5G NSA. Restricted device-segregation options are not available. Applying filters displays only matching authorised map results. Device groups and frequencies remain configuration-driven. Route Replay is out of scope."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance Criteria:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given an Automobile filter is edited, when SIM MCC, SIM MNC, MCC, MNC or LAC is entered, then the field accepts numeric digits only; MSISDN, CI, Site and Cell remain text inputs."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a standard Automobile map layer is active, when filters are opened, then time, handset, technology/frequency, network and available device-group filters are available."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the user applies one or more filters, when results reload, then only authorised results matching the active criteria are shown."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a Call layer is active, when technology filters are displayed, then 5G NSA is unavailable."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given configured frequencies or device groups are available, when filters are displayed, then they are offered without being hard-coded."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a restricted device-segregation option exists, when device groups are displayed, then it is unavailable."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given Route Replay is active, when filters are viewed, then this story’s standard-map filter controls do not apply."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
